---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy - LuxeRank">
  <fragment slot="header"><Header /></fragment>
  <fragment slot="footer"><Footer /></fragment>
  <section class="py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6" data-aos="fade-up">
      <h1 class="font-playfair text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-dark-bg mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="font-inter text-sm text-muted mb-12">Last updated:1 1, 2026</p>
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mt-8 mb-4">Introduction</h2>
        <p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-6">LuxeRank ("we" or "our") respects your privacy,and is committed to protecting your personal information.Privacy Policyexplains how we collect,use,store and protect your personal information,andthe rights you enjoy.</p>
        <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mt-8 mb-4">Information We Collect</h2>
        <p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">We may collect the following types of information:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-6 space-y-2">
          <li><strong class="text-dark-bg">Personal Information:</strong>When you subscribeournewsletter,Contactor participate in surveys,We may collect yourName,email addressAddressand other information.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-dark-bg">Technical Information:</strong>We use cookies and other tracking technologies to collect your browsing data, including IP address, browser type, access time, and more.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-dark-bg">Affiliate Marketing Data:</strong>We use third-party analytics tools to track your purchasing behavior for commission calculations.</li>
        </ul>
        <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mt-8 mb-4">How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">We use collected information for the following purposes:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Provide and improve our services</li>
          <li>Send newsletters and product recommendations</li>
          <li>Respond to your inquiries and requests</li>
          <li>Analyze website usage to optimize user experience</li>
          <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
        </ul>
        <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mt-8 mb-4">Information Sharing</h2>
        <p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-6">We will not sell your personal information. We may share information with the following third parties:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Affiliate marketing partners (e.g., Amazon Associates)</li>
          <li>Website analytics service providers</li>
          <li>Email marketing service providers</li>
        </ul>
        <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mt-8 mb-4">Your Rights</h2>
        <p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">Under privacy regulations such as GDPR and CCPA, you have the following rights:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Access personal information stored in our system</li>
          <li>Request correction of inaccurate personal information</li>
          <li>Request deletion of your personal information</li>
          <li>Object to processing of your personal information</li>
          <li>Data portability right</li>
        </ul>
        <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mt-8 mb-4">Contact</h2>
        <p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed">If you have any questions aboutPrivacy Policyany questions,please contact us at contact@luxerrank.com Contact.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
